{"slug":"n-ss-r","ar":"ن ص ر","total":158,"core":"help; victory; Christians","forms":[{"ar":"نَصَرَ","kind":"verb","form":1,"count":59,"gloss":"to help, aid","word":null,"ex":{"s":37,"a":116,"p":1,"ar":["وَنَصَرْنَـٰهُمْ","فَكَانُوا۟","هُمُ","ٱلْغَـٰلِبِينَ"],"en":"And We supported them so it was they who overcame"}},{"ar":"نَصِير","kind":"noun","form":null,"count":35,"gloss":"helper","word":null,"ex":{"s":33,"a":65,"p":8,"ar":["خَـٰلِدِينَ","فِيهَآ","أَبَدًا ۖ","لَّا","يَجِدُونَ","وَلِيًّا","وَلَا","نَصِيرًا"],"en":"Abiding therein forever, they will not find a protector or a helper"}},{"ar":"نَصْر","kind":"noun","form":null,"count":22,"gloss":"Victory, help","word":"nasr","ex":{"s":48,"a":3,"p":3,"ar":["وَيَنصُرَكَ","ٱللَّهُ","نَصْرًا","عَزِيزًا"],"en":"And [that] Allah may aid you with a mighty victory"}},{"ar":"نَصْرَانِيّ","kind":"name","form":null,"count":15,"gloss":"The Christians","word":"an-nasara","ex":{"s":3,"a":67,"p":6,"ar":["مَا","كَانَ","إِبْرَٰهِيمُ","يَهُودِيًّا","وَلَا","نَصْرَانِيًّا","وَلَـٰكِن","كَانَ","حَنِيفًا","مُّسْلِمًا","وَمَا","كَانَ","مِنَ","ٱلْمُشْرِكِينَ"],"en":"Abraham was neither a Jew nor a Christian, but he was one inclining toward truth, a Muslim [submitting to Allah]. And he was not of the polytheists"}},{"ar":"نَاصِر","kind":"active participle","form":null,"count":11,"gloss":"helper","word":null,"ex":{"s":3,"a":150,"p":6,"ar":["بَلِ","ٱللَّهُ","مَوْلَىٰكُمْ ۖ","وَهُوَ","خَيْرُ","ٱلنَّـٰصِرِينَ"],"en":"But Allah is your protector, and He is the best of helpers"}},{"ar":"ٱنتَصَرَ","kind":"verb","form":8,"count":7,"gloss":"to defend oneself; to take retribution","word":null,"ex":{"s":54,"a":10,"p":5,"ar":["فَدَعَا","رَبَّهُۥٓ","أَنِّى","مَغْلُوبٌ","فَٱنتَصِرْ"],"en":"So he invoked his Lord, \"Indeed, I am overpowered, so help"}},{"ar":"مُّنتَصِر","kind":"active participle","form":8,"count":4,"gloss":"able to help oneself","word":null,"ex":{"s":54,"a":44,"p":5,"ar":["أَمْ","يَقُولُونَ","نَحْنُ","جَمِيعٌ","مُّنتَصِرٌ"],"en":"Or do t